{
  "about": [
    "Test fixture (M1-11): a stand-in for M1-10-a's add-ons.v2.json, which wave 1 does not have yet. Format 2 keeps add-ons 1, 3, 4 and 6 with format 1's params and adds 10 humble-creator (uint8 preset 1-5: 1, 4, 8, 16 or 32 ETH per 30 days; box-spec-v2-draft.md \u00a7 6).",
    "Only the parts the checker reads: id, key, boxTypes, repeatable, params (name, type, enum, allowed, maxItems) and the enums. The real file wins as soon as it exists."
  ],
